      "problem": "What number is $12%$ greater than $1,500?$\n\nThe increased number is\n{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To find a number $12%$ *greater than* $1,500,$ we apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100%+12%=112%.\n$$\n\nWe convert this percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n112%=\\frac{112}{100}=1.12\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the original number by $1.12:$\n\n$$\n1,500\\times 1.12=1,680\n$$\n\nSo, the number that is $12%$ greater than $1,500$ is $1,680.$",
